# MIVA — Milestone Verification Agent

Trust layer for funding: founders submit milestone proof; the agent verifies against live sources; investors get an auditable verdict (approve / reject / needs more info). Humans make the final call.

## Stack

- Next.js (App Router) + TypeScript
- Orbio key = OpenRouter (`OPENROUTER_API_KEY`)
- Zod for schemas / structured outputs
- Tailwind for UI

## Clean code

- Prefer small, pure functions and thin components
- No unused imports, dead code, or speculative abstractions
- No comments that restate the code; comment only non-obvious intent or constraints
- Names reveal purpose; avoid `data`, `temp`, `handleStuff`
- Fail loudly with typed errors; never empty `catch {}`

## Contest constraints

- Ship a public demo: submit proof → structured verdict → investor review
- Show Orbio capabilities in-product (search, PDF, structured JSON)
- Do not build escrow/vesting in v1
